mages/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(4)-3270-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(5)-3270-p.png\"]','[]','2026-10-17 06:51:12','2026-10-27 13:26:16'),('prod_sofa_sandringham_01','Sandringham Large Bouclé 3-Seater Sofa','sandringham-large-boucl-3-seater-sofa','SAN-SOFA_SANDRINGHAM_01','Architectural proportions with pocket-sprung comfort and hardwood frame.','Handcrafted in the UK for luxurious comfort. The Sandringham Bouclé Sofa features architectural proportions, pocket-sprung seat cushioning, and a certified solid hardwood frame. Upholstered in premium textured cream bouclé compliant with UK Furniture & Furnishings (Fire Safety) Regulations 1988.','cat_sofas','published',149500,189500,20.00,'5060999990011','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555041469-a586c61ea9bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80','[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555041469-a586c61ea9bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\", \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493663284031-b7e3aefcae8e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\", \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\"]','[{\"id\": \"var_sandringham_boucle_cream\", \"title\": \"Cream Bouclé / 3-Seater\", \"sku\": \"SAN-SOF-SAND-01\", \"price_pennies\": 149500, \"stock_quantity\": 6, \"in_stock\": true}]','2026-10-26 07:57:21','2026-10-27 13:26:16');
