  ('prod_ftg_4267565', 'lyon-small-extending-dining-table-in-riviera-oak-white-high-gloss-90-180cm', NULL, 'Lyon Small Extending Dining Table in Riviera Oak/White High Gloss 90-180cm', 'Scandinavian Contemporary - Danish Design by Furniture To Go', 'The Lyon Small Extending Dining Table offers a practical and stylish solution for flexible dining spaces, finished in a Riviera Oak effect with a contrasting White High Gloss panel for a contemporary look. Designed to extend from 90cm to 180cm, it provides adaptable functionality, making it ideal for both everyday use and larger dining occasions. The clean lines and modern design ensure it integrates seamlessly into a variety of interior styles, while the sturdy construction supports long-term durability. This piece is a versatile addition to coordinated dining collections, combining style with space-saving practicality.\n\n• Extends from 90cm to 180cm for flexible dining\n• Riviera Oak finish with White High Gloss detail\n• Compact design ideal for space-saving solutions\n• Modern, clean-lined aesthetic for versatile styling\n• Durable construction for everyday use', 'cat_dining', 'published', 26040, 32550, NULL, '20.00', '5060912995575', 'https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/4/2/4267565_1.jpg', '[\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/4/2/4267565_1.jpg\",\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/4/2/4267565_2.jpg\",\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/4/2/426_lyon_oak_dining_1_1_1_1.jpg\",\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/4/2/426_lyon_oak_dining_1_2_1_1.jpg\",\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da5e8c6dc52ed3beb/w/h/white_frame_1.jpg\",\"https://furniture-to-go.co.uk/media/catalog/product/cache/384edea40d4e170da