  ('prod_live_am_3123rz', 'miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe', NULL, 'Miami Sonoma Oak Effect 4 Door 2 Drawer Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'Transform your bedroom with the Miami Sonoma Oak Effect Wardrobe. This spacious wardrobe features four doors and two drawers, offering ample storage for clothes, accessories, and more. The Sonoma Oak effect finish adds a touch of natural elegance, while the sturdy construction ensures lasting durability. Perfect for keeping your space organized and stylish. Sonoma Oak Effect 4 Doors  2 Drawers  Width 160cm Height 205cm Depth 52cm Flat Packed Delivery In 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 49728, 62160, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803123', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-3058-p.png', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-3058-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-(2)-3058-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-(3)-3058-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-(4)-3058-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-4-door-2-drawer-wardrobe-11008719-(5)-3058-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_3124rz', 'miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe', NULL, 'Miami Sonoma Oak Effect Corner Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'Maximize your storage space with the Miami Sonoma Oak Effect Corner Wardrobe. Featuring one door, a hanging rail, and five internal storage compartments, this wardrobe offers versatile storage solutions. The Sonoma Oak effect finish brings a touch of natural elegance to any room, while its sturdy construction ensures lasting durability. Perfect for keeping your corner spaces organized and stylish. Sonoma Oak Effect 1 Door Hanging Rail Shelving L Width 80cm R Width 80cm Height 205.1cm Flat Packed Delivery In 7-10 Days  DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 31920, 39900, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803124', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-3059-p.png', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-3059-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-(2)-3059-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-(3)-3059-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-(4)-3059-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/miami-sonoma-oak-effect-corner-wardrobe-11008710-(5)-3059-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_3125rz', 'sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe', NULL, 'Sorrento Oak Effect Tall Slim 2 Door Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'The Sorrento Oak Effect Tall Slim Wardrobe offers a sleek storage solution with a modern touch. Featuring two doors, it reveals three spacious internal shelves and a convenient pullout hanging rail. Its tall and slim design makes it perfect for compact spaces, providing ample storage without sacrificing style. The oak effect finish adds a warm, natural feel to any room. Artisan Oak effect 2 Doors 3 Internal Shelves  Width 70.5cm Height 194.5cm Depth 35cm Flat Packed Delivery in 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 27888, 34860, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803125', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-3060-p.png', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-3060-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-(2)-3060-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-(3)-3060-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-(4)-3060-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/sorrento-oak-effect-tall-slim-2-door-wardrobe-11008256-(5)-3060-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_3167rz', 'athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights', NULL, 'Athens Grey And White Gloss 2 Door Wardrobe With LED Lights', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', '\b Athens wardrobe in grey and white high gloss. This wardrobe features 2 doors with a combination of 2 hanging rails and shelves. Grey And White Gloss 2 Doors 2 Hanging Rails 4 Shelves LED Lights Included H 197cm W 102cm D 55.8cm Flat Packed Delivery In 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 59472, 74340, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803167', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-3081-p.png', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-3081-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-(2)-3081-1-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-(3)-3081-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-(4)-3081-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/athens-grey-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3167-(5)-3081-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_3175rz', 'cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights', NULL, 'Cadillac Oak Effect And White Gloss 2 Door Wardrobe With LED Lights', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'The Cadillac Oak Effect and White Gloss 2 Door Wardrobe offers a blend of modern design and functionality. Featuring LED lights, it includes two doors, two hanging rails, and four internal shelves, providing ample storage for your clothing and accessories. The oak effect and white gloss finish add a stylish touch to any bedroom decor. Oak Effect And White Gloss 2 Doors 2 Hanging  Rails 4 Shelves LED Lights Included H 197cm W 102cm D 55.8cm Flat Packed Delivery In 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 58968, 73710, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803175', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-3091-p.jpg', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-3091-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-(2)-3091-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-(3)-3091-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-(4)-3091-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/cadillac-oak-effect-and-white-gloss-2-door-wardrobe-with-led-lights-3175-(5)-3091-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_3413rz', 'granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers', 'SAN-3413', 'Granada Cashmere And Artisan Oak Effect Chest Of Drawers', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'The Granada Cashmere and Artisan Oak Effect Chest of Drawers combines a chic cashmere finish with artisan oak detailing. It features three spacious drawers and a convenient single door for versatile storage. A stylish and practical addition to any bedroom. Cashmere And Oak Effect 3 Drawers 1 Door H 90cm W 125cm D 40cm Flat Packed Delivery in 3-7 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 17400, 21750, NULL, '20.00', '5060912803413', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-3270-p.png', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-3270-p.png\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(2)-3270-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(3)-3270-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(4)-3270-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/granada-cashmere-and-artisan-oak-effect-chest-of-drawers-11013696-(5)-3270-p.png\"]', '[]', '2026-10-17 06:51:12', '2026-10-27 13:26:16'),
  ('prod_live_am_p4rxif74', 'rado-4-door-2-drawer-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe', NULL, 'Rado 4 Door 2 Drawer White High Gloss Mirrored Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', '\b Upgrade your bedroom with the Rado 4 Door 2 Drawer Wardrobe in white high gloss. This stylish wardrobe features four doors, including two mirrored, and offers ample storage with shelves, hanging rails, and two spacious drawers. Perfect for keeping your clothes and accessories organised while enhancing your room\'s modern aesthetic. White High Gloss Fronts Matt White Sides And Top 4 Doors 2 Drawers Shelves And Hanging Rails Height 192cm Width 164cm Depth 56cm Delivery Time 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 55104, 68880, NULL, '20.00', '5060912800474', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-2-drawer-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3154-3069-p.jpg', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-2-drawer-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3154-3069-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-2-drawer-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3154-(2)-3069-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_p4rxpl03', 'rado-3-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe', NULL, 'Rado 3 Door White High Gloss Mirrored Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', 'Transform your bedroom with the Rado 3 Door Wardrobe in white high gloss. This elegant piece features three doors, including one mirrored door, providing both style and functionality. Inside, you\'ll find ample storage with shelves and a hanging rail, perfect for organizing your clothing and accessories. White High Gloss Fronts Matt White Sides And Top 3 Doors 1 Mirrored Door Shelves And Hanging Rail Height 192cm Width 125cm Depth 56cm Dispatch Time 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 48552, 60690, NULL, '20.00', '5060912800403', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-3-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3153-3068-p.jpg', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-3-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3153-3068-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-3-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3153-(2)-3068-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_live_am_p4rxpl04', 'rado-4-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe', NULL, 'Rado 4 Door White High Gloss Mirrored Wardrobe', 'SAN Furniture Luxury Collection - Dispatch Time 2-7 Business Days', '\b Enhance your bedroom with the Rado 4 Door Wardrobe in white high gloss. This modern wardrobe features four doors, including two mirrored doors, offering both style and functionality. Inside, you\'ll find ample storage with shelves and hanging rails, perfect for organizing your clothing and accessories. White High Gloss Fronts Matt White Sides And Top 4 Doors With Mirrors Shelves And Hanging Rails Height 192cm Width 164cm Depth 56cm Flat Packed Delivery Time 7-10 Days DHD Service Available', 'cat_beds', 'published', 51744, 64680, NULL, '20.00', '5060912800404', 'https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3155-3070-p.jpg', '[\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3155-3070-p.jpg\",\"https://files.ekmcdn.com/amosmann1/images/rado-4-door-white-high-gloss-mirrored-wardrobe-3155-(2)-3070-p.jpg\"]', NULL, '2026-10-29 05:44:57', '2026-10-29 05:44:57'),
  ('prod_sofa_sandringham_01', 'sandringham-large-boucl-3-seater-sofa', 'SAN-SOFA_SANDRINGHAM_01', 'Sandringham Large Bouclé 3-Seater Sofa', 'Architectural proportions with pocket-sprung comfort and hardwood frame.', 'Handcrafted in the UK for luxurious comfort. The Sandringham Bouclé Sofa features architectural proportions, pocket-sprung seat cushioning, and a certified solid hardwood frame. Upholstered in premium textured cream bouclé compliant with UK Furniture & Furnishings (Fire Safety) Regulations 1988.', 'cat_sofas', 'published', 149500, 189500, NULL, '20.00', '5060999990011', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555041469-a586c61ea9bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80', '[\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555041469-a586c61ea9bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\", \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493663284031-b7e3aefcae8e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\", \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\"]', '[{\"id\": \"var_sandringham_boucle_cream\", \"title\": \"Cream Bouclé / 3-Seater\", \"sku\": \"SAN-SOF-SAND-01\", \"price_pennies\": 149500, \"stock_quantity\": 6, \"in_stock\": true}]', '2026-10-26 07:57:21', '2026-10-27 13:26:16');

